  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"955\">\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"883\">Positive IgG antibody titer</strong> indicates previous exposure or infection with Legionella pneumophila.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1056\">\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1056\"><strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"983\">High or rising titers</strong> (fourfold increase in paired sera) suggest recent or active infection.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1144\">\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1144\"><strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1078\">Negative result</strong> does not exclude infection, especially in early disease stages.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
